From ee2c7bfc95192b6eccd583aa85180f502474a3fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:30:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(library): add SMB shares as a remote library source

New :core:smb module (smbj 0.14.0) with a shared session pool, share
scanner and random-access reader. Library sync mirrors WebDAV (titles from
file names, albums from folders) through a shared remote-file snapshot
helper; playback reads smb:// URIs through a new Media3 DataSource placed
under the existing resolving/auth chain. Configured in Connect > Sources;
guest access and DOMAIN\user are supported. Offline pinning and
ReplayGain scanning are not enabled for SMB yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FEDCezPFi51Bf5mkmoEhB4
